@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### Home page
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Public list: Aurora, Sentinel; links lead to /heroes/{id}
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes

### Bonus 1: attribute route, Registered hero: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/heroes/1

### Bonus 1: min(1) does not match: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/heroes/0

### Bonus 1: the conventional route no longer reaches Details: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes/Details/1

### Draft hero: 404 with the "Page not found" page
GET {{baseUrl}}/heroes/3

### Unknown hero: 404 with the "Page not found" page
GET {{baseUrl}}/heroes/999

### Bonus 3: search, only Aurora
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes?search=aur

### Bonus 3: case-insensitive, only Sentinel
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes?search=SEN

### Bonus 3: a Draft is not found by search either: empty list
GET {{baseUrl}}/Heroes?search=shadow

### Bonus 4: no endpoint, still 404 with the "Page not found" page
GET {{baseUrl}}/doesnotexist

### Bonus 4: opened directly: 200, there is no original status
GET {{baseUrl}}/Home/Status/404
